<title>FINLAND: Finnish Nov wholesale prices rise 0.7 pct yr/yr-SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish Nov wholesale prices rise 0.7 pct yr/yr-SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish wholesale price index fell 0.7 percent in November on October and it rose 0.7 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			     Nov 1996    Oct 1996	Nov 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth		   -0.7 pct	+0.7 pct    -0.6 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		     +0.7 pct	+1.2 pct    -0.2 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
